Z||000028||MsBeth||11-14-2001||12:02 AM||||People who go on vacation and forget their medications.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_dizzy.gif"><P>People who are too lazy to call their doctors for refills on their medications-ask the pharmacist to call and then get mad at us when their doctor doesn't call the pharmacy back.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P>People who complain about the service at the store but keep coming back day after day, week after week and so on ... and complain some more  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_wtf.gif"><P>Smart people who don't read the labels on the medication bottles - the ones that say NO REFILLS .... and then get mad because the medication can't be refilled. ugh!<P>Sorry long day at work... lol<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/blue_2.gif">  <P>MsBeth||||reg||1
Z||000029||Neverfinished||11-14-2001||12:06 AM||||Observations from an 18 year old managing a car was and detail shop...................<P><BR>I hate used car salesmen that think i'm a flippin idiot and don't know ****  because i'm a 18 year old.<P>I hate people that come to my car wash and look at me like I'm just a punk teenager who is out to get them or lip them off.<P>I hate old bitter people that don't give you the time of day when you say hello or can I help you with something.<P>I hate truckers who drag hoses through their 5-th wheel and just leave it, requiring me to calm down a yuppie in his brand new rented motorhome who just got grease slopped on his brand new dockers.<P>I hate people that come in and expect me to detail their car in 15 minutes and charge them 15 bucks for quality work that takes 2 hours.<P>I hate guys that tell me they had a hard time chaging their friends gas tank in their fiero because they had to take out the engine to get to it.<P><BR>I hate not being able to find a GT fiero in BC or Alberta under 2000$ with a good interior and blown engine, or good engine...<P>VOYTEK------- CHECK YOUR PRIVATE MESSAGES PLEEZ---------------------------------<P><BR>I hate the loud squeal my window makes as it goes up<P>I HATE WINTER THAT WILL SOON BE COMING WHICH REQUIRES ME TO TAKE MY CAR OFF THE ROAD AND DRIVE A SHITTY 1987 TOYOTA TERCEL SEDAN<P>Man that felt good<BR>Good topic<BR><P>------------------<BR>To Be Old And Wise, You First Must Be Young And Stupid.-----------------<BR>It's not a waste of time... If you are wasted at the time||||reg||1
Z||000030||fierospeeder||11-14-2001||12:42 AM||||15 minutes, thats a joke.  <P>if i totally detail my car it takes 2 hours.  If i wanna do a car show detail, it probably take 5 hours.  <P>i hate people that try to kill me while i drive my motorcycle<P>i hate people that think they are better then you.  <P>i hate people that think they are smarter then you, just because they studied, but have no common sense at all.<P>i hate girls that just like cute guys, just cause they are cute and all they have to say is "hi" for them to be in love with.<P>i hate how people dont walk on the right side of aisles hallways etc...  then when you start walking towards the left they start doing the same.<P>i hate it when people know you fix your own car, and they want you to take a look at theirs.<P>i hate people that tell stupid jokes that are heard over and over again,  im a cashier at grocery store so ive heard the same thing.   is it free, must be.<P>i hate it when customers are 90% wrong but think the store is wrong because they grabbed the wrong product.<P>i hate it when the customers cough in my face or put their shopping card in their mouth and give it to me.  Id rather have anthrax.<P>i hate people that have to have a lawsuit for every little stupid thing.<P>i hate people who think ricers are da bomb.<P>i hate people who do the ricer drive by after you just beat them off the line just because i obey the speed limit.<P>i hate people asking me questions, family etc..  so whats new yada yada<P>i hate it when ebay has to update their systems on friday nights.<P>i hate it when a search is done on googles etc.., that a million sights pop up and non are related<P>i hate it that im not a porn star<P>i hate people that are afraid of y2k and the wtc incident, and stock up on supplies and buy gas like theres no tomorrow. and if theres no tomorrow, "why would you need gas?"<P><P>------------------<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000031||DaRkLoRD||11-14-2001||04:09 PM||||I thought of 2 more things I really hate.<P>-morning people.... I HATE getting up early, and if I didn't need to get up by 7 every day for work, I wouldn't. I also hate how some of these "morning people" call me lazy because I don't get up at 6am 7 days a week, and love it... if I stay up working until 4am (which I did often as a web designer) and then sleep in until 11am... how the heck does that make me lazy?? sometimes I think these people don't understand that I don't go to bed at the same time they do.. it's not like I sleep 16 hours a day!<P>I also hate people who are so f*cked up that they think that seeing a naked female will totally destroy a boy's mind.. I think there's something wrong with a person if they think that killing innocent animals is fun, watching people be hurt or killed is entertainment.. yet seeing an image of a human in their NATURAL FORM is offensive... (tasteful here.. not really talking about hardcore porn....) my neighbors across the street have 3 kids.. they still won't allow them to watch cable tv, or anything other than G rated movies (and 2 of the kids are in high school!!) because they think it will "corrupt" the kids or something.. here's an idea, if kids are sheltered a lot when they're living at home, how are they gonna deal with anything when they are on their own?? kids that are babied that much end up being helpless weenies who either can't cope with everyday life, or end up not being able to handle situations, and often turn to drugs, alcohol or other reckless behaviour as a way of personally rebelling or just dealing with life.<P>don't let kids run wild, but if they're sheltered and prevented from experiencing some of the "real" stuff in life when they're young enough to get advice and guidance from parents on how to deal with it.. they're gonna be totally f***ed later on in life.<P>this is how I feel.. that's fine if anyone doesn't agree...<P>------------------<BR>     <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>     <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A><p>[This message has been edited by DaRkLoRD (edited 11-14-2001).]||||reg||4
